195871557","actor":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-11-19T23:57:08Z","label":{"name":"Bug","color":"ffcfcf"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/63739094","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/5659#issuecomment-63739094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/5659","id":63739094,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYzNzM5MDk0","user":{"login":"WestLangley","id":1000017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDAwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1000017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley","html_url":"https://github.com/WestLangley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-20T00:06:36Z","updated_at":"2014-11-20T00:06:36Z","body":"OK, this does appear to be a Gimbal-lock problem, and the solution in these cases is not unique.\n\nWe will have to do something like this:\n\nIf the \"middle\" rotation is computed to be close to + or - PI / 2, then set the \"third\" rotation to zero, and compute the rotation for the \"first\" axis using a different formula than we are using -- a formula we are going to have to figure out.\n\nI'd appreciate help from anyone on this.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/63739094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"WestLangley","id":1000017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDAwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1000017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley","html_url":"https://github.com/WestLangley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/63745036","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/5659#issuecomment-63745036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/5659","id":63745036,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYzNzQ1MDM2","user":{"login":"bhouston","id":588541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODU0MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/588541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston","html_url":"https://github.com/bhouston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-20T01:08:31Z","updated_at":"2014-11-20T01:44:11Z","body":"Hi @WestLangley!\n\nThanks for your input so quickly.  You are correct it is a singularity issue.\n\nI checked what ILM's math library does in this case (I consider it to be the gold standard in math libraries because its been around a decade and we use it for everything in C++.)  It actually converts from Quaternion to Matrix33 and then to Euler -- it avoids the direct Quaternion to Euler conversion, so it avoids the issue we've run into:\n\nhttps://github.com/openexr/openexr/blob/master/IlmBase/Imath/ImathEuler.h#L465\n\nBut ILM math favors correctness over speed.  It would be nice to also have speed.\n\nHere is a great math page that shows logic that covers singularities at the polls.  It first uses the above formulation from Wikipedia and then develops into something more along what Three.JS currently, except without the normalization (/unit) for the arcsin component:\n\nhttp://www.euclideanspace.com/maths/geometry/rotations/conversions/quaternionToEuler/\n\nThe above seems to be the most thorough coverage of the issues.\n\nBTW the use case for this is that it just sometimes arises in Clara.io that we have one of these Quaternions to convert to Euler angles and it fails badly.  It doesn't happen often but when it does happen things go really bad, basically things go flying off the screen when they shouldn't be.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/63745036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bhouston","id":588541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODU0MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/588541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston","html_url":"https://github.com/bhouston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":195897755,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTk1ODk3NzU1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/events/195897755","actor":{"login":"WestLangley","id":1000017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDAwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1000017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley","html_url":"https://github.com/WestLangley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-11-20T01:08:31Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":195897756,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDE5NTg5Nzc1Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/events/195897756","actor":{"login":"WestLangley","id":1000017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDAwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1000017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley","html_url":"https://github.com/WestLangley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WestLangley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-11-20T01:08:31Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/63745714","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/5659#issuecomment-63745714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/5659","id":63745714,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYzNzQ1NzE0","user":{"login":"bhouston","id":588541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODU0MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/588541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston","html_url":"https://github.com/bhouston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-20T01:16:15Z","updated_at":"2014-11-20T01:20:18Z","body":"To be honest, I prefer correctness over speed, and handling all the special cases for the various different orders looks like its going to be a lot of code.\n\nWe could technically replace the current `Euler.setFromQuaternion()` function with a closure that allocates a Matrix4 and uses it as an intermediate, thus following the precedent set by ILM's math library.  This will reduce the size of ThreeJS (because it reuses the existing Matrix4 code) and correctly works in all cases (or at least I believe so.)\n\nSomething like this:\n\n``` javascript\nmakeRotationFromQuaternion: function() {\n   var mIntermediate = new THREE.Matrix4();\n   return function( q, order ) {\n      mIntermediate.makeRotationFromQuaternion( q );\n      this.setFromRotationMatrix( mIntermediate, order );\n      return this;\n   };\n},\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/63745714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bhouston","id":588541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODU0MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/588541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston","html_url":"https://github.com/bhouston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhouston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":195921366,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDE5NTkyMTM2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/events/195921366","actor":{"